# wie_validate --keys: the whole path in one run. Logo → title (any key) → main menu →
# 게임 방법 (contents, then every page from 2/8) → settings (vibration off, level 쉬움, motion
# 켬 → 줄임 → 끔 → 켬, right soft key back) → 최고 기록 → 제작자 정보 (left soft key) → 게임 시작
# (level card: 보통) → play → left soft key = pause → right soft key = 계속 → play → CLR = pause →
# 처음 화면으로 (yes) → 이어하기 → play (a snake sweep) until the time bar runs out → end card →
# CLR → menu → CLR "나가시겠어요?" no → 게임 나가기 → yes: the MIDlet ends (stop "clean exit").
# Key names only; the board is random, so the moves are blind. The sweep ends well inside the
# round, so no key lands on the end card. Run: ../arcade-common/README.md §확인.
